TITLE VII: COURT FEES
CHAPTER ONE: COURT FEES
Article 269: Depositing and refunding of
court fees
Deposit of court fees is provided by the
Minister in charge of justice. The deposit is
done in case of:
1° filing action;
2° opposition;
